# PatiKlinik — elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi: humao.rest-client)
#
# Kullanım: `make up` ile sistemi başlatın, önce aşağıdaki 6 giriş isteğini çalıştırın ("Send Request").
# Token'lar sonraki isteklerde {{vet.response.body.access_token}} gibi otomatik kullanılır.
# Demo hayvanlar: 1 Karamel (yavru köpek, 2 sahip, fatura sorumlusu Ece), 2 Mırnav (kedi, rapeli gecikmiş),
# 3 Karamel'in mükerrer kaydı (çipsiz), 4 Zeytin (Collie). Demo sahipler: 1 Deniz, 2 Ece, 3 Deniz'in mükerrer kaydı.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@pw = Demo123!

### ============================ Kimlik ============================

# @name vet
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "vet@patiklinik.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name tech
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "tekniker@patiklinik.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name rec
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "resepsiyon@patiklinik.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name pharm
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "eczane@patiklinik.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name owner
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "sahip@patiklinik.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

###
# @name owner2
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "sahip2@patiklinik.test", "password": "{{pw}}"}

### Yanlış parola → 401 invalid_credentials
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "vet@patiklinik.test", "password": "yanlis"}

### Refresh token rotation (aynı refresh token ikinci kez kullanılırsa 401 ve oturum ailesi iptal)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token": "{{vet.response.body.refresh_token}}"}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### Sağlık
GET {{base}}/health

### ============================ Yetki ihlalleri ============================

### Token yok → 401
GET {{base}}/api/animals

### Sahip ilaç listesine erişemez → 403
GET {{base}}/api/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.access_token}}

### Ece (sahip2) Deniz'in kedisini göremez → 403
GET {{base}}/api/animals/2
Authorization: Bearer {{owner2.response.body.access_token}}

### Resepsiyon reçete yazamaz → 403
POST {{base}}/api/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================ F-1 Sahip ve hayvan ============================

### Sahip ara (ad öneki ya da telefon), keyset sayfalama
GET {{base}}/api/owners?q=Deniz&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Sahip kaydı
# @name newOwner
POST {{base}}/api/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name": "Selin Yıldız", "phone": "05551234567", "email": "selin@example.com"}

### Hayvan kaydı (doğum tarihi bilinmiyor → tahmini yaş), aşı planı otomatik oluşur
# @name newAnimal
POST {{base}}/api/animals
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sokak Kedisi", "species": "cat", "breed": "mixed", "sex": "female",
  "estimated_age_months": 3, "weight_kg": "1.4",
  "owners": [{"owner_id": {{newOwner.response.body.id}}, "is_billing": true}]
}

### Sahip portal daveti: kimliği doğrulanan sahibe tek kullanımlık, 48 saat geçerli kod (yalnız bu yanıtta görünür)
# @name invite
POST {{base}}/api/owners/{{newOwner.response.body.id}}/portal-invite
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "selin@example.com"}

### Sahip hesabını etkinleştirir (kimlik doğrulaması gerekmez); başarılıysa oturum açılır
POST {{base}}/api/auth/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "selin@example.com", "code": "{{invite.response.body.code}}", "password": "Guclu12345"}

### Mikroçiple ara
GET {{base}}/api/animals?microchip=900002654435761
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Hayvan + sahipler (sahip yalnız kendi hayvanını görür)
GET {{base}}/api/animals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.access_token}}

### Ortak sahip ekle
POST {{base}}/api/animals/{{newAnimal.response.body.id}}/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner_id": 1, "relation": "co_owner"}

### Kilo geçmişi
GET {{base}}/api/animals/1/weights
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================ F-3 / T-1 Aşı ============================

### Karamel'in aşı takvimi ve motor açıklaması (plans[].planned[].reason)
# @name karamelVacc
GET {{base}}/api/animals/1/vaccinations
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### Mırnav: gecikmiş FVRCP rapeli bugüne planlı (overdue: true)
GET {{base}}/api/animals/2/vaccinations
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.access_token}}

### Planlı dozu uygula (doz no'yu yukarıdaki yanıttan seçin); paketten seans düş
POST {{base}}/api/vaccine-doses/{{karamelVacc.response.body.doses[0].id}}/administer
Authorization: Bearer {{tech.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: asi-uygulama-ornek-0001

{"batch_no": "DHPP-2026-0042", "use_package": true}

### Planı yeniden hesapla (idempotent)
POST {{base}}/api/animals/1/vaccinations/replan
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### Hatırlatma job'ı (ikinci çalıştırmada created: 0)
POST {{base}}/api/jobs/reminders/run
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Sahibin hatırlatmaları (e-posta şablonu metniyle)
GET {{base}}/api/reminders?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================ F-2 / T-3 Randevu ============================

### Kaynaklar
GET {{base}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Günlük takvim
GET {{base}}/api/appointments?date=2026-10-26
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Randevu oluştur (aynı veteriner/oda/saat ikinci kez → 409 resource_conflict)
# @name appt
POST {{base}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: randevu-ornek-0001

{"animal_id": 1, "vet_id": 1, "room_id": 4, "kind": "vaccination", "starts_at": "2026-12-15T10:00:00+03:00", "duration_min": 30}

### Durum: geldi
POST {{base}}/api/appointments/{{appt.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "checked_in"}

### Muayene (randevuyu tamamlar, kiloyu günceller)
POST {{base}}/api/examinations
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"appointment_id": {{appt.response.body.id}}, "animal_id": 1, "weight_kg": "8.1", "temperature_c": "38.7", "findings": "Genel durum iyi, aşıya engel yok", "diagnosis": "Sağlıklı"}

### ACİL VAKA: şimdi başlar, çakışan randevular en az bozulmayla taşınır (moves, disruption_cost)
POST {{base}}/api/appointments/emergency
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 4, "duration_min": 45, "reason": "Trafik kazası", "room_kind": "exam_room"}

### Muayene geçmişi
GET {{base}}/api/animals/1/examinations
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================ F-4 / T-2 İlaç ve reçete ============================

### İlaçlar, doz aralıkları, kontrendikasyonlar, stok
GET {{base}}/api/drugs
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### Kedi + parasetamol → 422 contraindicated (gerekçe olsa bile)
POST {{base}}/api/dosage/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 2, "drug_id": 3, "doses_per_day": 1, "duration_days": 1, "override_reason": "denemek için yazılan gerekçe"}

### Collie + ivermektin → 422 contraindicated (MDR1)
POST {{base}}/api/dosage/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 4, "drug_id": 4, "doses_per_day": 1, "duration_days": 1}

### Ketamin seyreltme: adım adım hesap (C1·V1 = C2·V2)
POST {{base}}/api/dosage/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 4, "drug_id": 5, "mg_per_kg": "5", "doses_per_day": 1, "duration_days": 1, "dilute_to_mg_per_ml": "10"}

### Azami doz aşımı gerekçesiz → 422 max_dose_exceeded
POST {{base}}/api/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 4, "drug_id": 1, "mg_per_kg": "0.3", "doses_per_day": 1, "duration_days": 3}

### Gerekçeli onayla yazılır (exceeds_max: true, denetim kaydına düşer)
# @name rx
POST {{base}}/api/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: recete-ornek-0001

{"animal_id": 4, "drug_id": 1, "mg_per_kg": "0.3", "doses_per_day": 1, "duration_days": 3, "override_reason": "Şiddetli ağrı, uzman konsültasyonu ile"}

### Kiloyu değiştir → eski reçete değişmez (weight_changed_note)
POST {{base}}/api/animals/4/weights
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"weight_kg": "30.0"}

###
GET {{base}}/api/prescriptions/{{rx.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### Eczane kuyruğu
GET {{base}}/api/prescriptions?status=active&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{pharm.response.body.access_token}}

### Teslim (FEFO, süresi geçmiş parti kullanılmaz)
POST {{base}}/api/prescriptions/{{rx.response.body.id}}/dispense
Authorization: Bearer {{pharm.response.body.access_token}}

### Stok
GET {{base}}/api/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{pharm.response.body.access_token}}

### Stok girişi
POST {{base}}/api/stock/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{pharm.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"drug_id": 1, "lot_no": "L01-C", "expires_on": "2027-12-31", "quantity": 100}

### ============================ F-5 Yatan hasta ============================

### Kafes panosu (allowed_next: durum makinesinin izin verdiği geçişler)
GET {{base}}/api/cages
Authorization: Bearer {{tech.response.body.access_token}}

### Geçersiz geçiş: boş → hazır → 409 cage_invalid_transition
POST {{base}}/api/cages/10/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tech.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": "ready"}

### Yatış (kafes verilmezse uygun ilk kafes)
# @name adm
POST {{base}}/api/hospitalizations
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 4, "reason": "Travma sonrası gözlem"}

### Not
POST {{base}}/api/hospitalizations/{{adm.response.body.id}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{tech.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "Sıvı tedavisi başladı"}

### Taburcu → kafes temizliğe geçer
POST {{base}}/api/hospitalizations/{{adm.response.body.id}}/discharge
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### Temizlik → hazır
POST {{base}}/api/cages/{{adm.response.body.cage_id}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tech.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": "ready"}

### Aktif yatışlar
GET {{base}}/api/hospitalizations?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================ F-6 / T-4 Fatura, tahsilat, paket ============================

### Karamel'e fatura: kural → fatura sorumlusu Ece (owner_id 2, billing_rule: billing_owner)
# @name inv
POST {{base}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 1, "lines": [{"description": "Muayene ücreti", "quantity": 1, "unit_price_kurus": 75000}, {"description": "Karma aşı", "quantity": 1, "unit_price_kurus": 45000}]}

### Açıkça Deniz'e kes (billing_rule: explicit)
POST {{base}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal_id": 1, "owner_id": 1, "lines": [{"description": "Kontrol", "quantity": 1, "unit_price_kurus": 30000}]}

### Kısmi ödeme — aynı Idempotency-Key ile tekrar gönderin: aynı yanıt, Idempotent-Replayed: true, tek ödeme
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/{{inv.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: odeme-ornek-0001

{"amount_kurus": 50000, "method": "card"}

### Fazla ödeme → 422 overpayment
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/{{inv.response.body.id}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount_kurus": 999999, "method": "cash"}

### Fatura ayrıntısı
GET {{base}}/api/invoices/{{inv.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Ece kendi faturalarını görür
GET {{base}}/api/invoices?status=
Authorization: Bearer {{owner2.response.body.access_token}}

### Paketler ve paket satışı
GET {{base}}/api/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/package-purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"package_id": 1, "animal_id": 1}

### Karamel'in paketleri (sessions_left)
GET {{base}}/api/animals/1/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{owner.response.body.access_token}}

### Fatura sorumlusunu değiştir
PUT {{base}}/api/animals/1/billing-owner
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner_id": 1}

### ============================ T-4 Mükerrer kayıt birleştirme ============================

### Olası mükerrer sahipler (1 ↔ 3 aynı telefon)
GET {{base}}/api/duplicates/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Olası mükerrer hayvanlar (1 ↔ 3 Karamel)
GET {{base}}/api/duplicates/animals
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Sahip birleştir: 3 → 1
# @name mergeOwner
POST {{base}}/api/merges
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"entity": "owner", "survivor_id": 1, "duplicate_id": 3}

### Geri al (ikinci kez → 409 already_undone)
POST {{base}}/api/merges/{{mergeOwner.response.body.id}}/undo
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Hayvan birleştir: 3 → 1 (aşı geçmişleri birleşir, plan yeniden hesaplanır)
# @name mergeAnimal
POST {{base}}/api/merges
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"entity": "animal", "survivor_id": 1, "duplicate_id": 3}

###
POST {{base}}/api/merges/{{mergeAnimal.response.body.id}}/undo
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Birleştirme geçmişi
GET {{base}}/api/merges
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================ Gözlem ============================

### Denetim kaydı (append-only): kim, ne zaman, neyi, eski/yeni değer
GET {{base}}/api/audit?entity=invoice&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{rec.response.body.access_token}}

### Canlı pano
GET {{base}}/api/stats/live
Authorization: Bearer {{vet.response.body.access_token}}
